Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Prometheus not scraping targets
Solution:

# Check Prometheus pod logs
kubectl logs -n monitoring deployment/prometheus

# Verify RBAC permissions
kubectl get clusterrolebinding prometheus

# Check service discovery
kubectl get endpoints -n monitoring
Issue 2: Grafana cannot connect to Prometheus
Solution:

# Verify Prometheus service is running
kubectl get svc -n monitoring prometheus-service

# Check if Prometheus is accessible from Grafana pod
kubectl exec -n monitoring deployment/grafana -- wget -qO- http://prometheus-service.monitoring.svc.cluster.local:8080/api/v1/query?query=up
Issue 3: No data in dashboards
Solution:

# Check if metrics-server is running
kubectl get pods -n kube-system | grep metrics-server

# Verify Prometheus configuration
kubectl get configmap -n monitoring prometheus-config -o yaml

# Check Prometheus targets status via API
curl http://<MINIKUBE_IP>:30000/api/v1/targets
